  "releaseNotes": "* Fixed authentication bugs introduced into 4.12.0 related to adding GSSAPI and native NTLM auth support which causes problems on Linux/Mac. (issue #1910 and #1911)\n* Reverted System.Threading.Tasks.Extensions dependency back to 4.6.2.\n* Reverted System.Formats.Asn1 dependency back to 8.0.1.",
  "repository": "",
